      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IDEAL WHISPER (2) continued his strong form when led from a couple of spots wider and went on to score by 2.5m at this circuit and distance last week. Ultra consistent colt who is yet to miss a place and he has the speed to take advantage of the low draw. That could see him hard to catch. The outside barrier has served up a real challenge to HEZ THE BOSS (9) but he is impossible to knock after winning eight on the trot, beating IDEAL WHISPER to take the Westbred Classic last start. Only needs a touch of luck and his class could carry him to another feature. IGNITE THE FURNACE (1) came from this barrier when runner-up to Hez the Boss in the Westbred Classic and overcame a much wider barrier when winning here prior. Should enjoy a soft run and get every chance. OFF SHORE NZ (7) had to work last start and may be relying on luck from an even wider barrier but he had shown talent when winning his WA debut here prior so include.",
